# Ports the Ruby 3.4 MKXP-Z build and VM patches to Ruby 4.1.0-preview1.
# Fiddle, monitor, pathname and win32ole are no longer default extensions.
# Excludes pre-unpacked bundled gem extensions as well as their installation.
# ractor_check_ints and rb_w32_start_process no longer exist upstream.
# Restores Ruby 3.4's legacy msvcrt.dll FILE/ioinfo layout in win32.c; Ruby 4 assumes UCRT.
# Allows YJIT on x86_64 MinGW, linking the windows-gnu Rust stdlib's native libraries.
# Keeps .refptr.rb_* global after the YJIT partial link (mingw COMDAT stubs) and drops .llvmbc.
# Partially links only Rust objects on mingw: ld -r otherwise loses their .pdata/.xdata.
# Moves rustc's raw-dylib import stubs to libyjit-imports.a: ld -r breaks their .idata.

